#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:19
msgid "Karpathy's LLM Wiki"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"Build and maintain a persistent, compounding knowledge base as "
"interlinked markdown files. Based on [Andrej Karpathy's LLM Wiki "
"pattern](https://gist.github.com/karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:24
msgid ""
"Unlike traditional RAG (which rediscovers knowledge from scratch per "
"query), the wiki compiles knowledge once and keeps it current. Cross-"
"references are already there. Contradictions have already been flagged. "
"Synthesis reflects everything ingested."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"**Division of labor:** The human curates sources and directs analysis. "
"The agent summarizes, cross-references, files, and maintains consistency."
msgstr ""

