"skill loads — check the `[Skill config: ...]` block above for the active "
"value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:55
msgid ""
"The wiki is just a directory of markdown files — open it in Obsidian, VS "
"Code, or any editor. No database, no special tooling required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:58
msgid "Architecture: Three Layers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:76
msgid ""
"**Layer 1 — Raw Sources:** Immutable. The agent reads but never modifies "
"these. **Layer 2 — The Wiki:** Agent-owned markdown files. Created, "
"updated, and cross-referenced by the agent. **Layer 3 — The Schema:** "
"`SCHEMA.md` defines structure, conventions, and tag taxonomy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:81
msgid "Resuming an Existing Wiki (CRITICAL — do this every session)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:83
msgid ""
"When the user has an existing wiki, **always orient yourself before doing"
" anything**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:85
msgid ""
"① **Read `SCHEMA.md`** — understand the domain, conventions, and tag "
"taxonomy. ② **Read `index.md`** — learn what pages exist and their "
"summaries. ③ **Scan recent `log.md`** — read the last 20-30 entries to "
"understand recent activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:97
msgid "Only after orientation should you ingest, query, or lint. This prevents:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:98
