#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:160
msgid "Page Thresholds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:161
msgid ""
"**Create a page** when an entity/concept appears in 2+ sources OR is "
"central to one source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:162
msgid "**Add to existing page** when a source mentions something already covered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:163
msgid ""
"**DON'T create a page** for passing mentions, minor details, or things "
"outside the domain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:164
msgid ""
"**Split a page** when it exceeds ~200 lines — break into sub-topics with "
"cross-links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:165
msgid ""
"**Archive a page** when its content is fully superseded — move to "
"`_archive/`, remove from index"
msgstr ""

