#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:217
msgid ""
"**Scaling rule:** When any section exceeds 50 entries, split it into sub-"
"sections by first letter or sub-domain. When the index exceeds 200 "
"entries total, create a `_meta/topic-map.md` that groups pages by theme "
"for faster navigation."
msgstr ""

