#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:358
msgid "Archiving"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:360
msgid "When content is fully superseded or the domain scope changes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:361
msgid "Create `_archive/` directory if it doesn't exist"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:362
msgid ""
"Move the page to `_archive/` with its original path (e.g., "
"`_archive/entities/old-page.md`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:363
msgid "Remove from `index.md`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:364
msgid ""
"Update any pages that linked to it — replace wikilink with plain text + "
"\"(archived)\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:365
msgid "Log the archive action"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:367
msgid "Obsidian Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:369
msgid "The wiki directory works as an Obsidian vault out of the box:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:370
msgid "`[[wikilinks]]` render as clickable links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:371
msgid "Graph View visualizes the knowledge network"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:372
msgid "YAML frontmatter powers Dataview queries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:373
msgid "The `raw/assets/` folder holds images referenced via `![[image.png]]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:375
msgid "For best results:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:376
msgid "Set Obsidian's attachment folder to `raw/assets/`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:377
msgid "Enable \"Wikilinks\" in Obsidian settings (usually on by default)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:378
msgid ""
"Install Dataview plugin for queries like `TABLE tags FROM \"entities\" "
"WHERE contains(tags, \"company\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:380
msgid ""
"If using the Obsidian skill alongside this one, set `OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH`"
" to the same directory as the wiki path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:383
msgid "Obsidian Headless (servers and headless machines)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:385
msgid ""
"On machines without a display, use `obsidian-headless` instead of the "
"desktop app. It syncs vaults via Obsidian Sync without a GUI — perfect "
"for agents running on servers that write to the wiki while Obsidian "
"desktop reads it on another device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:389
msgid "**Setup:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:411
msgid "**Continuous background sync via systemd:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:436
msgid ""
"This lets the agent write to `~/wiki` on a server while you browse the "
"same vault in Obsidian on your laptop/phone — changes appear within "
"seconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:439
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:441
msgid ""
"**Never modify files in `raw/`** — sources are immutable. Corrections go "
"in wiki pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:442
msgid ""
"**Always orient first** — read SCHEMA + index + recent log before any "
"operation in a new session. Skipping this causes duplicates and missed "
"cross-references."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:444
msgid ""
"**Always update index.md and log.md** — skipping this makes the wiki "
"degrade. These are the navigational backbone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:446
msgid ""
"**Don't create pages for passing mentions** — follow the Page Thresholds "
"in SCHEMA.md. A name appearing once in a footnote doesn't warrant an "
"entity page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:448
msgid ""
"**Don't create pages without cross-references** — isolated pages are "
"invisible. Every page must link to at least 2 other pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:450
msgid ""
"**Frontmatter is required** — it enables search, filtering, and staleness"
" detection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:451
msgid ""
"**Tags must come from the taxonomy** — freeform tags decay into noise. "
"Add new tags to SCHEMA.md first, then use them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:453
msgid ""
"**Keep pages scannable** — a wiki page should be readable in 30 seconds. "
"Split pages over 200 lines. Move detailed analysis to dedicated deep-dive"
" pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:455
msgid ""
"**Ask before mass-updating** — if an ingest would touch 10+ existing "
"pages, confirm the scope with the user first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:457
msgid ""
"**Rotate the log** — when log.md exceeds 500 entries, rename it `log-"
"YYYY.md` and start fresh. The agent should check log size during lint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/llm-wiki_SKILL.md:459
msgid ""
"**Handle contradictions explicitly** — don't silently overwrite. Note "
"both claims with dates, mark in frontmatter, flag for user review."
msgstr ""

